name: Baseball Card — uncommon X1.5
author: corpus
description: >-
  Baseball Card gives X1.5 Mult for each Uncommon Joker you have. First-shop uncommon
  density engine: fill slots with uncommons (Mime, Showman, Cartomancer, Smeared Joker,
  Pareidolia) and duplicate the strongest.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: BaseballCard
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Mime
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Cartomancer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
